# The frontend has no environment variables.
#
# This is deliberate: the app renders entirely from the in-memory fixtures in
# `lib/data.ts`, so there is nothing to configure and nothing to leak. The file
# exists so that is a documented decision rather than an oversight.
#
# When the backend in ../backend is built, its base URL belongs here:
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.example.com
